    "problem": "If $D=\\{(x,y)\\hspace{0.222em}:\\hspace{0.222em}(x-1)^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 1,\\hspace{0.222em}y\\ge 0\\}$, then $$\n\\displaystyle ∬_(D)x\\sqrt{x^{2} + y^{2}}dA =\n$$",
